OL,3,CWhere to watch the solar eclipse in
OL,4,Cthe South and South East
OL,6,FPeople living in the South and South
OL,7,FEast of England are expected to
OL,8,Freceive some of the best viewing
OL,9,Fconditions in the country for
OL,10,FWednesday's solar eclipse.
OL,12,FThe spectacular phenomenon will be the
OL,13,FUK's fullest for 54 years and see more
OL,14,Fthan 90% of the sun obscured by the
OL,15,Fmoon.
