OL,3,CWhere to watch the solar eclipse in
OL,4,Cthe South and South East
OL,6,FThe Met Office has said our region
OL,7,Fwill experience 'excellent' viewing
OL,8,Fconditions, with much of Dorset,
OL,9,FHampshire and the Thames Valley
OL,10,Fforecast to enjoy between 92-94% solar
OL,11,Fcoverage.
OL,13,FHere, ITV News Meridian explains when
OL,14,Fand where you can watch the solar
OL,15,Feclipse.
OL,17,FWhen is the solar eclipse?
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
