OL,3,CWhere to watch the solar eclipse in
OL,4,Cthe South and South East
OL,6,FThe eclipse will take place on
OL,7,FWednesday (August 12) evening, with
OL,8,Fthe moon obscuring the sun between
OL,9,F6.17pm and 8.06pm.
OL,11,FWhere can I watch in the South East?
OL,13,FAcross Sussex, Surrey and Kent, there
OL,14,Fare a number of free and ticketed
OL,15,Fevents which people can attend to
OL,16,Fcatch some of the best sights of the
OL,17,Feclipse. They include:
